7. Logging

from medorbits.logging_config import (
    configure_logging,
    get_logger,
    log_context,
)
configure_logging()
logger = get_logger("medorbits.app")
with log_context(
    request_id="req-example-001",
    correlation_id="corr-example-001",
):
    logger.info(
        "Application processed",
        extra={
            "application_id": "APP-1001",
            "status": "received",
        },
    )

Example environment settings:

LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json

Use LOG_FORMAT=text for readable console output where appropriate.

Request and correlation IDs should be validated before use. Do not accept arbitrary untrusted values as trusted identity or authorization claims.

